Package: qemu-manager
Version: 9.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, qemu-system
Maintainer: driftcore-gif
Description: QEMU Manager — GTK4 QEMU virtual machine manager
 Full-featured QEMU VM manager with disk creation, QEMU 11 support,
 VirGL/VirtIO-GPU-GL acceleration, TB-scale storage, confidential VMs,
 and M3-style dark UI. Disk selection: create new / use existing / no disk.
